res of 7\u201310 \u2014 have lifespans in the centuries\u2026 and some wonder if they might be immortal. </div> </div> </div>Also:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Superhuman Metabolism: A nova draws some degree of sustenance from the quantum energies he channels. A character can go a number of days equal to his Quantum score without food, water or sleep before suffering any ill effects. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/299-ninedaysdead","name":"NineDaysDead","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"188"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-28T20:06:41-07:00","id":1333060,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>NineDaysDead</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1331470-what-does-slow-aging-1-do?p=1333041#post1333041\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">From Aberrant D20 page 147 &amp;quot;Quantum Benefits&amp;quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Also:<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>I like features like this. Minor automatic boosts and benefits. Gonna include things like this in my automatic house rules file. <br /> <br /> I hope Onyx realizes such thimgs like this are beneficial to keep and put it back in.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date"